  id: Scene06_FAQ_3
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: 'Ohm did exactly what we are about to do: he changed the electrical conditions
    in his circuit, step by step, and measured what happened each time. He repeated
    it over and over and wrote every reading down. Let''s go and see.'
